-+      <section class="about-story section-pad"><div><p class="eyebrow">Our philosophy</p><h2>Train with<br /><em>purpose.</em></h2></div><div class="about-story-copy"><p>ONYX started with a simple observation: most gyms sell access. Rows of machines, a swipe card, and good luck. We think people deserve more than access — they deserve direction.</p><p>Every session at ONYX is coached, every program is progressive, and every member is known by name. We measure success not in check-ins, but in first pull-ups, first 5Ks, and the quiet confidence of people who trust their bodies again.</p><p>That is what “harder to break” really means to us — not just stronger muscles, but sturdier lives.</p></div></section>
